# Conformance probe pack for the item limit shared by the outer and the inner
# lines (spec 0.34, max_items), most significant bit first. Public. No kinds.
#
#   deltas      an 8-bit count, then that many items, val in 8 bits each, signed
#   the rest    one conformance-inner-restonly message
format     conformance-inner-budget
version    0.34.0
distribution public
source  "goat-transformers spec/engine-spec.md (synthetic probe format, no external standard)"
uses       probe
wire       bits
layout     sequential
bit_order  msb
group   probe.deltas count 8
  field  probe.val  8  twos
end
inner   conformance-inner-restonly
